                                                "sense_id": "11d388cc-e7fe-3e93-b1ad-f2736479fbd4",
                                                "text": "a faded rock star of the 1970s"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24cd7357-2afc-4f3c-a532-9688176ae95f",
                                                "sense_id": "11d388cc-e7fe-3e93-b1ad-f2736479fbd4",
                                                "text": "Some clients adjust their instructions as faded memories come into focus. Mr. Li recalled one prospective client who spent most of an hourlong phone call crying as she reminisced about her old home."
