                                                "sense_id": "50652865-6344-3036-9592-78da374689c9",
                                                "text": "As I'm walking through the festival entrance, a man casually vomits before continuing on, unfazed. ¶ Twenty-year-old me thinks, \"Dope. That guy knows how to get faded like a champ!\" ¶ Thirty-year-old me thinks, \"I'm concerned for the boy's health and the general sanitation of this festival. Where are the comment cards located?!\""
                                            }
